<p><strong>Addendum 2798.5 - Projected Cessation of SCP-2798</strong></p>
<p>SCP-2798 is currently projected to cease activity in:</p>
<h2 id="toc1"><span><a href="/kalinins-proposal">SCP-2798 HAS CEASED FUNCTION. SCP-001 UNCONTAINED. WORLDWIDE EMERGENCY PROTOCOLS ARE NOW IN EFFECT</a></span></h2>
